# FriendsOfCake Search

## Plugin semantics

`friendsofcake/search` provides paginate-able filters via a Search manager/filters on Tables (commonly through the Search behavior) and controller integration for applying request filter params. Prefer plugin filters over ad-hoc `where` piles in controllers.

## Required behavior

- Apply only when `friendsofcake/search` ^7 is installed.
- Configure filters on the Table/search manager; keep HTTP orchestration in the controller thin.
- Do not assume FriendsOfCake CRUD APIs from this pack alone.
- Prefer named Table finders for reusable non-filter query semantics still.

## Anti-patterns

- Building large uncontrolled query strings in controllers instead of filters
- Inventing Laravel Scout APIs
- Requiring CRUD listeners for plain Search usage
